WEBVTT

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.370
Who are you?

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:24.840
Wait!

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.370
I haven't done anything!

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.560
This extraordinary case

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.790
in which a person was trapped
in a block of ice and died...

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:49.330
Another weird case.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.470
What's going on lately?

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.770
So many weird things
have been taking place.

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:56.360
The Metropolitan Police Department
is investigating the incidents

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.670
as possible murders or accidents.

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:58.640
Miyu?

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.130
What's wrong?

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:01.240
Uh, nothing.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.840
It can't be...

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:08.540
I'm sure of it.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.740
That was a stray Shinma.

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:55.590
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.670
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:05.470
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:10.200
However, there are stray Shinma...

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.500
...that live secretly
in the human world.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:17.150
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:23.980
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:29.390
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.830
No one knows her true face.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.020
Anyway, it has
been hot lately!

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.730
They said it would be
a cool summer this year.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.130
Is that so?

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.500
Don't you watch
the news sometimes?

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.930
I DO watch...
like this morning...

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.100
Huh? What's wrong?

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:16.540
No... nothing.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:21.780
Excuse me.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:24.080
Can you tell me
where Miyu is?

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.390
Miyu's absent today
because of a cold.

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:29.620
Oh, no, a cold?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:32.060
What do you
want from Miyu?

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.460
Any message?

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.390
Let me see...

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.990
Then please tell her
that Reiha said hello.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.060
And that I will
come see her soon.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.470
Your name is Reiha?

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:48.700
You are Miyu's friend?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.510
An old friend.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:55.350
Since many
decades ago.

00:04:03.090 --> 00:04:04.250
She vanished!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.450
It was a really cold wind.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.060
What has happened?

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.480
Is it really her doing?

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:34.290
I can't think of anyone but Reiha
to freeze a stray Shinma.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.960
She is disregarding you...

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:38.420
...and doing something
fairly flamboyant.

00:04:38.890 --> 00:04:40.880
Maybe she wants
to make me mad.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.990
What are you
going to do, Miyu?

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:47.170
I don't want to be
provoked into going out there.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:51.700
But if you leave her alone,
she might get carried away.

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:54.640
And she might end up
acting violently during the day.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:05:00.070
She's not stupid enough
to appear in front of humans.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.370
You never know.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.010
Maybe I need
to settle it finally.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:09.890
That's right, Miyu. If you keep
letting her disregard you...

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:12.450
...you lose face
as a Guardian.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.150
It's not that...

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.760
It's just that Reiha and I
cannot live in the same world.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:22.270
I don't understand
the details about it...

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.040
That cloud!

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.770
What can you see?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.510
It's very suspicious.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.910
It reeks of demonic air.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:45.430
Good morning!

00:05:46.190 --> 00:05:47.220
It's cold, isn't it?

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.790
I had a hard time
finding winter clothes.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.500
What's wrong?

00:05:52.070 --> 00:05:54.060
Well, it's about Miyu...

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:55.640
What about Miyu?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.530
Isn't she a little weird?

00:05:58.940 --> 00:05:59.910
In what way?

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:04.200
Because wherever she goes...
like when we went on a trip...

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.900
...she wore a school
uniform, remember?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.980
She is absent
from school often, too.

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:10.850
That's her own business.

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:17.020
But in the case of Miho
and Ruri Sone in Class "A"...

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.420
...they... sort of became
weird afterwards...

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:22.760
Chisato, you were
chased by a ghost...

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.760
...that looked just
like Miyu to begin with.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:27.390
Everything happened
after Miyu came.

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:31.200
Well, it's probably because...
it must all be coincidence...

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:33.940
Do you know where
Miyu's house is, Chisato?

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.910
Huh? Um... no.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.440
She never wanted
me to come visit her.

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:41.570
- It's Saikawa Cemetery.
- What?

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.810
I asked Teacher Kawaguchi
what Miyu's address was...

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.250
...and it turns out that it's
where that cemetery is.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.860
I don't think
the teacher is aware...

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.650
...because he
didn't say anything.

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:54.990
Isn't it strange?

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:56.500
It's...

00:06:56.660 --> 00:07:01.330
We don't think Miyu
is doing anything bad.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:05.370
It's just because of
that weird girl yesterday...

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:09.030
...we should be
a little cautious.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:13.240
I don't like that.

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.380
We understand
how you feel.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.080
No, you don't!

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:19.140
Miyu is my friend.

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.320
She has nothing
to hide from me!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:23.190
Chisato...

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:24.560
Good morning.

00:07:24.930 --> 00:07:26.450
Uh... good morning.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.460
What's wrong?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.600
Nothing.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:34.660
By the way, Miyu,
that classic Japanese homework...

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:35.740
You can copy it.

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:37.400
Thank you...

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:53.750
Cold!

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:57.620
You don't have
enough clothes on!

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:58.830
I'm fine.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.230
You were absent from school
yesterday because of a cold.

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:04.490
Ah, I forgot.

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:05.770
Come on!

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:07.660
You are absent-minded.

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:09.940
Thank you.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:12.900
- Hey... Miyu...
- What?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:15.800
You still have it, don't you?

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:17.850
Yes.

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:22.780
We'll be friends
forever, right?

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.640
What's wrong...
so suddenly?

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.620
Do you know a girl
by the name of Reiha?

00:08:28.760 --> 00:08:30.520
She dresses in a kimono
like a doll.

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.560
Did she do anything to you?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.730
No.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.420
But we saw her
in front of school yesterday...

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:38.260
...and she was
talking about you.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:41.530
She said, "I will
see her soon."

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:42.640
Is that so?

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.030
Who is she?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:46.800
She doesn't like me.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.180
Are you in some
kind of trouble?

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:51.030
You can talk to me
about anything!

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:54.040
Thank you,
but it's really nothing.

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:58.080
Miyu, you're hiding
something from me, aren't you?

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:02.120
Why? Aren't we friends?

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:06.950
There are things that
I can't even tell my friends.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:10.330
That's strange, because...

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:11.990
Ah! What is that?

00:09:28.120 --> 00:09:29.080
Reiha...

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:58.070
The trains are currently not
running due to too much snow.

00:09:58.510 --> 00:10:01.070
We have no idea when we
will be able to resume services.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.120
You have finally come.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:47.230
You should know what
I have come here to do.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:49.790
And... how she is feeling.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:52.560
Is this it?

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:54.970
Yes.

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:58.970
We wanted to fight with
you to our hearts' content...

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:00.900
...where we don't
get disrupted.

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.930
I don't want to fight.

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:06.980
You still say such a thing!

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.640
Do you think you will win?

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.950
What confidence!

00:11:12.720 --> 00:11:14.210
You are not going
to be in the mood...

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.920
...unless you deal with all
the stray Shinmas all over Japan?

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:19.760
Or do we need
to tempt you?

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.480
What do you mean?

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:25.720
I can let it snow
more and more.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:31.930
If I keep at it, your dear friends
might freeze to death.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.330
Do you think such
a threat would work?

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:38.740
Sure, because you are
very lenient with humans.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.780
We don't mind freezing
people around you... one by one.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.680
That's not necessary!

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.320
Now you are
finally in the mood.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:52.020
We'll put an end
to this today!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.230
I see... you can't fight
without your servant.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:00.760
Same with you.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:04.100
No. We are only one
who appear as two.

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:06.030
That's why... here!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.210
What's this?

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:17.920
Ha ha ha. Be quiet in there...
until we defeat Miyu.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:19.190
Larva!

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.910
I just put a barrier
around him.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:22.480
Don't worry.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.150
It's just you that
we want to defeat.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:28.390
Matsukaze,
stay put where you are.

00:12:48.520 --> 00:12:50.070
There is no ending
to this, don't you see?

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.280
It's far from over.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.310
Do you hate me
that much?

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.520
Don't you
understand yet?

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:00.320
My resentment?

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:03.130
WORLD'S BEST MAGIC SHOW

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:21.150
At that moment Father
did not call out my name.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:27.850
Father died as your
Shinma Protector, Miyu.

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.350
So did everyone
in the theater company.

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:31.530
Why?

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:35.790
Why do only you get to live
with protection from everyone?

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:37.830
It's not for my personal sake.

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.090
It's because I'm a Guardian.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.560
It's a Shinma Protector's duty...

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:44.600
...to send a Guardian
into this world.

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:46.470
It's as simple as that.

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.940
I'm also left alone.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.180
No.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:54.540
You have no idea
what I went through.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:02.880
Which way should I go?

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.060
You feel lonely
and helpless?

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.520
You'll be fine, Reiha.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.960
You have the power of Shinma.

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.100
No.

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.590
I'm just a child.

00:14:13.030 --> 00:14:14.860
I have no powers.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.140
Little girl,
you saw, didn't you?

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:30.310
I know nothing.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.580
It's not that simple.

00:14:32.820 --> 00:14:35.050
You are not lucky
to have met me.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:39.060
Don't be scared, Reiha.

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:41.730
You are the child
of a Shinma's child, as well.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.630
But what do I do?

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:50.240
Is that doll going
to save you, little girl?

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.110
What... What is it?

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:03.350
You... I see.
You're a Shinma, too.

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:10.860
Father, Mother!

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.200
Oh! No!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:42.520
What did I just do?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.750
- Reiha...
- Mother?

00:15:49.700 --> 00:15:50.720
Mother!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:55.700
Reiha,
you inherited my power.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.770
You can manipulate
wind and snow.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:00.730
I can?

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:04.740
From now on,
go forward with that power...

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:07.040
...because you are all alone.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:08.420
Mother!

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:29.140
This is my power, isn't it?

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:30.930
See, Reiha.

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:32.530
You are strong.

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:35.770
Let's put away
all the stray Shinmas.

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:38.000
Father didn't have to die...

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:41.080
...if I could have used
this power back then.

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:42.600
You can't help it now.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:46.710
Your father didn't want you,
Reiha, to be a Shinma Protector.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:49.920
Now I understand, Father...

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:54.130
Ever since then...

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.790
...I have only been thinking
about defeating stray Shinma.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.070
And then... some day...
you, too, Miyu.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.300
If it weren't for you...

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.700
I would have been able
to live happily with my father.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.370
I don't blame you
for resenting me.

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:14.410
But, Reiha,
I can't leave you alone.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.880
Because... I'm a Guardian.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:21.650
I wouldn't be able to rest
unless I defeated you.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.020
We can't forgive you...

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.890
...for leading an easy life
just because you are a Guardian.

00:17:27.860 --> 00:17:31.260
If you say it's your destiny,
we'll simply change it.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:33.760
No one can do such a thing.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.960
Yes... I'll show you.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.180
You can't defeat us like that.

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.220
Us?

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.060
I see.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:14.270
Matsukaze!
Matsukaze!!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.370
Matsukaze!

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:24.880
Reiha...

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:28.180
I... protected you...

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.390
Father...

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:34.060
So you were
the real Reiha...

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:37.590
No. We were one.

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:43.060
I wanted to preserve my anger
and hatred the way it was...

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:45.600
...so that I would never forget.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:47.740
That was Matsukaze.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.570
No matter how painful
the memory was...

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:54.910
...he was the only thing left
for me to connect with my father.

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:58.840
I have lost even THAT!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:00.750
Because of YOU!

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.610
This is it for you.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:31.890
Be prepared!

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:03.020
You called for help again.

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:05.410
No, that's not the case.
Larva is...

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:09.220
No. You always had
someone beside you.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:11.760
Someone who
would protect you.

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:15.490
I was not defeated by you.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:19.890
When Miyu wishes to get away
from the circle of destiny...

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:22.770
...I will terminate Miyu's life.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:26.230
Because we are
sharing the same blood.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.810
No, I will be the one
to defeat Miyu.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:35.440
I need to go search
for myself once again.

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:40.620
But, Miyu, I WILL
defeat you some day.

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:45.790
With more mighty,
angry power than ever.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.620
Until then, farewell...

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:03.970
I'll be waiting
for you, Reiha.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.980
Are you all right, Miyu?

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:13.880
Larva, would you
really terminate me?

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:16.650
If the time comes...

00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.050
Reiha doesn't understand...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:23.530
...what it is like to be
burdened with destiny.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:24.860
Yes.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.690
I might have forgotten
about it a little bit...

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:31.900
I might have been
around humans too much.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:34.700
You ARE a Guardian, Miyu.

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:37.210
I know.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:57.790
Reiha might
have been crying.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:02.190
Melting snow kept running
for a long, long time.

00:22:13.110 --> 00:22:18.570
The door opens,
and before me is eternity

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:25.350
Whose voice calls
from so far away?

00:22:25.890 --> 00:22:31.760
Someone smoothes down my hair...
Who are you?

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:39.300
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for

00:22:39.570 --> 00:22:44.310
Where time
and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.610 --> 00:22:48.410
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:52.720
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.550 --> 00:23:01.360
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away

00:23:04.830 --> 00:23:11.170
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:17.830
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.810 --> 00:23:26.280
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:32.920
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:46.360
The door opens,
and before me is eternity

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:53.140
Whose voice calls
from so far away?

00:23:53.680 --> 00:23:59.550
Someone smoothes down my hair...
Who are you?

00:24:03.360 --> 00:24:07.050
