my heart so wishes for

00:24:07.360 --> 00:24:12.090
Where time
and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:16.200
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.570 --> 00:24:20.370
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:29.150
