washed away

00:24:32.620 --> 00:24:38.960
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth

00:24:39.190 --> 00:24:45.620
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.600 --> 00:24:54.060
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain

00:24:54.310 --> 00:25:00.680
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.090 --> 00:25:08.710
The boy was a bird who had
strayed away from the group.

00:25:09.490 --> 00:25:13.320
He found his true self
in the damp plain in the north.

00:25:13.630 --> 00:25:16.720
He flapped and spread
his luminous wings.

00:25:16.800 --> 00:25:19.890
But they glow
only in the dark.

00:25:20.670 --> 00:25:23.660
Yes... those are wings
meant only for battles.

00:25:24.300 --> 00:25:26.430
In the next episode of
Vampire Princess MIYU...

00:25:26.570 --> 00:25:27.840
"The Boy Who Returned."

00:25:28.940 --> 00:25:31.410
What story does
a bird tell at night?
